  "description": "College senior Seo Jeong-ha decides it’s finally time to list the speaker her ex-boyfriend gave her on a secondhand marketplace app.\n\nHer reason is simple. She’s recently started seeing Park Min-jun, a handsome, incredibly sweet guy with major boyfriend potential, and keeping her ex’s baggage around is nothing but a massive headache.\n\nFeeling lighter than ever, Jeong-ha heads out to meet the buyer, only to find the absolute last person she ever expected waiting for her…\n\nHer ex-boyfriend, Choi Seo-hoon.\n\nHow much do you think this thing costs?! And you’re selling it for a measly hundred and fifty bucks?!\n\nA chaotic love triangle romance sparked by a secondhand deal gone completely wrong!\n\n**Original Webtoon:**   \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=850709), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=14159069)",
